  "notes": {
    "nemotron": "Nemotron\u2019s Auto Ontology run went through Auto Ontology\u2019s OpenAI-compatible client, which cannot switch off Nemotron\u2019s reasoning; it used up Auto Ontology\u2019s 8,192-token output limit on 1,120 calls, and several answers came back empty. Its held-out run, and repeats through Auto Ontology\u2019s NVIDIA client with reasoning off, were rate-limited by the NVIDIA API and are discarded and listed, so Nemotron has no held-out result inside Auto Ontology."
  },
  "question_text": {
    "development": {
      "1": "Which functions call upsert_table_term?",
      "2": "What does the semantic module do?",
      "3": "Which non-test files have no docstring description?",
      "4": "Where is resolve_semantic_fks defined, and what does its docstring say?",
      "5": "How many Python files, test files and symbols does the repository have?",
      "6": "Which commit of which repository does this code map describe?",
      "7": "Which public functions in auto_ontology/semantic have no test linking to their file?",
      "8": "Which ten non-test functions or methods are called from the most call sites in non-test code?",
      "9": "Which files import auto_ontology/dal/terms.py?",
      "10": "Which test files cover auto_ontology/semantic/semantic_fk.py, and why are they linked?",
      "11": "What would be affected if resolve_semantic_fks changed? List every resolved caller symbol, including standalone functions, methods and class-scope callers, reached directly or indirectly, with the shortest call depth, outside the tests.",
      "12": "Which packages under auto_ontology have the most lines of non-test code? Give the top five.",
      "13": "Which classes define the most methods? Give the top five.",
      "14": "What share of direct call sites could the static analysis resolve, by resolution kind?",
      "15": "Which modules in auto_ontology/connectors does auto_ontology/connectors/__init__.py import?",
      "16": "Which non-test modules are never imported by another file in the repository? Leave out package __init__.py files, __main__.py files and the Alembic migration directory.",
      "17": "Which functions does _run_semantic_compilation call, and where are they defined?",
      "18": "Which packages have the highest share of public symbols without a docstring? Consider packages with at least 20 public symbols outside the tests and give the top five.",
      "19": "Which pairs of packages call into each other in both directions?",
      "20": "Which files import, directly or through other files, auto_ontology/semantic/constants.py? Give the number of such non-test files per directory, using the first two levels of each file's directory.",
      "21": "Which test file links to the most source files?",
      "22": "Which public classes in auto_ontology/connectors are used only as base classes: subclassed by other non-test classes but never constructed by a resolved call? Give the number of non-test subclasses of each."
    },
